# Components

One folder per element: `src/components/<Name>/<Name>.ts` and a colocated CSS file. Register it with a side-effect import at the top of `src/main.ts`. Static shell tags also go in `src/index.html`. List and table nodes are created in `main.ts`.

- Extend `HTMLElement`. In the constructor: `attachShadow({ mode: 'open' })`, `adoptStyles(this.shadowRoot!, styles)`, then clone a module-level `<template>`.
- Import CSS as `import style from './name.css?inline'`.
- Define the tag as `app-` plus kebab-case: `globalThis.customElements.define('app-example', Example)`.
- Events listened to from outside the shadow root use `bubbles: true` and `composed: true`.
- Render `Player` data with `createElement`, `append`, and `replaceChildren`. Format cells with `formatPlayerField`.
- Empty matches render `<app-no-results>`. Position deltas use `<app-ranking-change>` and its `value` setter.
- Accordion content is slotted: `collapsed` and `expanded`.

```ts
const $template = document.createElement('template');
$template.innerHTML = `<div class="example"></div>`;

export class Example extends HTMLElement {
  constructor() {
    super();
    this.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' });
    adoptStyles(this.shadowRoot!, exampleStyle);
    this.shadowRoot!.append($template.content.cloneNode(true));
  }
}

globalThis.customElements.define('app-example', Example);
```
